'sbt coverage test coverageReport' and 'sbt scalafmtCheck' steps. Added both plugins
(org.scoverage:sbt-scoverage 2.4.4, org.scalameta:sbt-scalafmt 2.5.2) and a minimal
.scalafmt.conf (version 3.10.7, scala3 dialect — 'default Scala 3 style' per
tech-stack.md, no custom overrides).

Files changed:
- project/plugins.sbt (new)
- .scalafmt.conf (new)

Note: running scalafmtCheckAll for the first time flags nearly every pre-existing file
across all three modules as unformatted, since scalafmt was never actually run before.
Reformatting the whole codebase is out of scope for this persistence-focused track —
only formatted the files this track itself touched (see next commit). Left the rest for
a separate cleanup track/backlog item.
